<title>CHINA: Vincent 13-month net loss HK$2.89 mln.</title>
<headline>Vincent 13-month net loss HK$2.89 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 13 months ended April 30.</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.1 loss  vs  8.6 loss (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  8.20 gain vs  9.07 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    2.89 loss vs  20.53 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     405.99    vs  566.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Vincent Intertrans (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Vincent Intertrans is a freight forwarder.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to April 30 from March 31. Comparative figures are for 12 months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on disposal of land and buildings.</p>
<p>The calculation of loss per share is based on the weighted average of 269.14 million shares (13 months) vs 237.34 million (12 months), after adjustment of the number of shares in issue prior to the rights issue on April 1.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
